        "TileImage": "$($repository 95fc9e66-0251-42db-a6ce-23dbcabc760d).Image",
        "Description": "These 4 people were involved in the &quot;Max &amp; Lucas Jewelry&quot; heist that took place a couple months ago. 16 were severely and permanantly injured, and 4 died. Ever since then they decided to lay low in an old town called &quot;Whittleton Creek&quot; an old suburban neighborhood looking innocent enough for them to continue to communicate in secrecy.\r\rThese people are dangerous. However because of them lying low, most of them are unarmed.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
